<h3>Content</h3>
<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">T</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            navigates to today's time period.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">C</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            opens the popup for creation of new appointment.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Shift</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">Left Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            navigates to the previous time period.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Shift</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">Right Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            navigates to the next time period.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Alt</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">1, 2, 3</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            navigates to the view with the respective number.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>

<h3>Appointments</h3>
<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-descr">
            All of the content keyboard shortcuts work when focus is on the appointment. In addition to that we also have:
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Arrow Keys</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            move focus through appointments.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Enter</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            opens the Edit Popup to modify the appointment.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Delete/Backspace</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            opens the Delete confirmation popup to modify the appointment.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>

